      lower triangle and ``U`` in its upper.
    - ``piv`` is an array of shape ``(..., K)`` with ``K = min(M, N)``,
      which encodes the pivots.

  See Also:
    - :func:`jax.scipy.linalg.lu`
    - :func:`jax.scipy.linalg.lu_solve`

